{% comment %}
  PURELANE PRODUCT CARD — the single card abstraction.

  The assignment: "Several sections render similar cards. Build accordingly."
  This snippet is that card. It is consumed by the shop grid, by the combo
  tray stacks, by the bundle tier strips, and by the category tiles, with a
  variant switch rather than four copies of the markup.

  WHY NOT DAWN'S snippets/card-product.liquid
  It is reused in spirit, not in markup. Dawn's card is built around
  .card__inner / .ratio / --ratio-percent and Dawn's card_style, card colour
  scheme and badge-position theme settings. The Purelane card is a glass shell
  with a fixed-height media slot, a corner pill, a rating line and a
  bottom-pinned price row - the two markup trees do not overlap enough for an
  override to be cleaner than a purpose-built snippet. What IS reused from
  Dawn: the <product-form> custom element and {% form 'product' %} for real
  AJAX add-to-cart (assets/product-form.js), the loading-spinner snippet, the
  reviews.rating metafield convention, and Dawn's locale strings.

  VARIANTS
  - grid     full card: media, badge, title, rating, price, CTA   (#shop)
  - stack    compact tile + caption, no chrome                    (#combos)
  - strip    bare artwork only                                    (#bundles)
  - category artwork + label                                      (bonus)

  EDGE CASES HANDLED HERE, ONCE, FOR EVERY CONSUMER
  - sold out       real product.available, disabled CTA, neutral badge, and the
                   state stated in text rather than by colour alone   (DEV-007)
  - missing image  the prototype's own dashed leaf tile               (DEV-008)
  - long title     two-line clamp with reserved height so a long title cannot
                   break row rhythm                                   (DEV-006)
  - no compare-at  compare-at and saving are simply omitted, never "0% off"
  - no rating      rating line omitted, never "0 stars"
  - multi-variant  routes to the product page instead of a broken add-to-cart
  - deleted product / blank input renders nothing

  Accepts:
  - product: {Object} the product (required - renders nothing when blank)
  - variant_style: {String} grid | stack | strip | category. Default 'grid'
  - section_id: {String} owning section id, for unique form ids (required for CTA)
  - show_rating: {Boolean} default true (grid only)
  - show_price: {Boolean} default true (grid only)
  - show_cta: {Boolean} default true (grid only)
  - saving: {String} passed to purelane-price. 'percent' (default) | 'amount' | 'none'
  - badge_text: {String} explicit badge override. Falls back to the product's
      custom.badge metafield (optional)
  - caption: {String} stack variant benefit caption. Falls back to the
      product's custom.benefit metafield (optional)
  - image_loading: {String} 'lazy' (default) | 'eager'
  - image_fetchpriority: {String} 'high' for LCP candidates (optional)
  - image_sizes: {String} sizes attribute override (optional)
  - class: {String} extra classes on the card root (optional)

  Usage:
  {% render 'purelane-product-card', product: product, section_id: section.id %}
  {% render 'purelane-product-card', product: item, variant_style: 'stack' %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- if product != blank -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign style = variant_style | default: 'grid'
    assign is_available = product.available
    assign first_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant

    # Badge: explicit override first, then the product's own metafield.
    # Never a hardcoded "Best seller".
    assign pl_badge = badge_text | default: product.metafields.custom.badge.value

    # Benefit caption for combo stacks, same precedence.
    assign pl_caption = caption | default: product.metafields.custom.benefit.value

    # A product with several variants cannot be added from a card without a
    # variant picker, so the CTA becomes a link to the product page.
    assign needs_options = false
    if product.variants_count > 1
      assign needs_options = true
    endif

    assign card_classes = 'pl-card pl-card--' | append: style
    unless is_available
      assign card_classes = card_classes | append: ' pl-card--soldout'
    endunless
    if style == 'grid' or style == 'category'
      assign card_classes = card_classes | append: ' pl-glass'
    endif
    if class != blank
      assign card_classes = card_classes | append: ' ' | append: class
    endif
  -%}

  {%- case style -%}
    {%- comment -%} ---------------- STACK: combo tray items ---------------- {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- when 'stack' -%}
      <span class="{{ card_classes }}">
        {%- render 'purelane-media',
          image: product.featured_image,
          alt_fallback: product.title,
          sizes: '(max-width: 760px) 56px, 66px'
        -%}
        {%- if pl_caption != blank -%}
          <span class="pl-card__caption">{{ pl_caption }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </span>

    {%- comment -%} ---------------- STRIP: bundle tier artwork ---------------- {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- when 'strip' -%}
      <span class="{{ card_classes }}">
        {%- render 'purelane-media',
          image: product.featured_image,
          alt_fallback: product.title,
          decorative: true,
          sizes: '(max-width: 760px) 54px, 62px'
        -%}
      </span>

    {%- comment -%} ---------------- CATEGORY: artwork + label ---------------- {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- when 'category' -%}
      <a class="{{ card_classes }}" href="{{ product.url }}">
        <span class="pl-card__ph">
          {%- render 'purelane-media',
            image: product.featured_image,
            alt_fallback: product.title,
            decorative: true,
            sizes: '(max-width: 760px) 142px, 176px'
          -%}
        </span>
        <span class="pl-card__txt">
          <span class="pl-card__title">{{ product.title | escape }}</span>
          {%- if pl_caption != blank -%}
            <span class="pl-card__caption">{{ pl_caption }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
        </span>
      </a>

    {%- comment -%} ---------------- GRID: the full shop card ---------------- {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign show_the_rating = true
        if show_rating == false
          assign show_the_rating = false
        endif
        assign show_the_price = true
        if show_price == false
          assign show_the_price = false
        endif
        assign show_the_cta = true
        if show_cta == false
          assign show_the_cta = false
        endif
        assign form_id = 'pl-add-' | append: section_id | append: '-' | append: product.id
        assign title_id = 'pl-title-' | append: section_id | append: '-' | append: product.id
        assign sold_out_label = 'products.product.sold_out' | t
      -%}
      <article class="{{ card_classes }}">
        <div class="pl-card__shot">
          {%- if is_available == false -%}
            <span class="pl-card__badge">
              {%- render 'purelane-badge', text: sold_out_label, style: 'soldout' -%}
            </span>
          {%- elsif pl_badge != blank -%}
            <span class="pl-card__badge">
              {%- render 'purelane-badge', text: pl_badge, style: 'pill' -%}
            </span>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- render 'purelane-media',
            image: product.featured_image,
            alt_fallback: product.title,
            loading: image_loading,
            fetchpriority: image_fetchpriority,
            sizes: image_sizes
          -%}
        </div>

        <h3 class="pl-card__title" id="{{ title_id }}">
          <a class="pl-card__link" href="{{ product.url }}">{{ product.title | escape }}</a>
        </h3>

        {%- if show_the_rating -%}
          {%- render 'purelane-rating', product: product -%}
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if show_the_price -%}
          {%- render 'purelane-price', product: product, saving: saving, class: 'pl-card__price' -%}
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if show_the_cta -%}
          <div class="pl-card__cta">
            {%- if is_available == false -%}
              <button type="button" class="pl-btn pl-btn--ghost pl-btn--sm pl-btn--full" disabled>
                {{ 'products.product.sold_out' | t }}
                <span class="pl-sr">&mdash; {{ product.title | escape }}</span>
              </button>

            {%- elsif needs_options -%}
              <a class="pl-btn pl-btn--ghost pl-btn--sm pl-btn--full" href="{{ product.url }}">
                {{ 'products.product.choose_options' | t }}
                <span class="pl-sr">&mdash; {{ product.title | escape }}</span>
              </a>

            {%- else -%}
              {%- comment -%}
                Dawn's <product-form> handles the fetch, the cart drawer or cart
                notification refresh, and error messaging. Reusing it means the
                Purelane card behaves exactly like every other Dawn card.
              {%- endcomment -%}
              <product-form data-section-id="{{ section_id }}">
                {%- form 'product',
                  product,
                  id: form_id,
                  class: 'pl-card__form',
                  novalidate: 'novalidate',
                  data-type: 'add-to-cart-form'
                -%}
                  <input
                    type="hidden"
                    name="id"
                    value="{{ first_variant.id }}"
                    class="product-variant-id"
                  >
                  <button
                    type="submit"
                    name="add"
                    class="pl-btn pl-btn--ghost pl-btn--sm pl-btn--full"
                    aria-labelledby="{{ form_id }}-label {{ title_id }}"
                  >
                    <span id="{{ form_id }}-label">{{ 'products.product.add_to_cart' | t }}</span>
                    {%- render 'loading-spinner' -%}
                  </button>
                {%- endform -%}
              </product-form>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </article>
  {%- endcase -%}
{%- endif -%}
